<title>UK: BOE allots 650 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 650 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 650 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 537 million stg in bills outright and 113 million stg in repos to March 25 and 26.</p>
</text>
